@A = https://localhost:7170

### Random: A relays whatever B finally answers
GET {{A}}/api/external-service

### Force an outcome in B
GET {{A}}/api/external-service?mode=unavailable

### 404 is not transient: never retried
GET {{A}}/api/external-service?mode=notfound

### Slow B: attempt timeout is 2 s (from ch04)
GET {{A}}/api/external-service/slow?ms=3000

### POST is not retried (from ch04)
POST {{A}}/api/external-service/orders?mode=unavailable
